a tech if necessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24929,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","user":"econclark","date":".  missed a limitation on crafting. 01-14-2021, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T17:30:45-08:00","id":1432024,"title":"","content":"Depending on their capabilities, you could simply craft them as core tech or pheraps novatech. I mean, look at what Boston Dynamic can do now, and imagine what their drones could do after a Nova with MEgaint 3 and some of the design edges gives them a once over.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}